      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage, while the dense carrier continues through the pipeline.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR end to end: encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, decoder.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a dense field before it is split into windows. The compact thought process reads and updates those window tokens. The repeated ticks share parameters, so recurrence does not mean a larger stack of separate stages.",
